3. inner{sq(area=9), rect(area=10) [2x5]}
4. outer{inner{sq(area=9), rect(area=10) [2x5]}, sq(area=9)}
5. empty{}
largest: outer{inner{sq(area=9), rect(area=10) [2x5]}, sq(area=9)}
rect(area=10) [2x5]

